category: Python
build-depends: cygport python312-hatch-fancy-pypi-readme python312-hatch-vcs python312-hatchling python312-colorlog python312-jinja2 python312-lxml python312-pygments
sdesc: "Generate code coverage reports with gcc/gcov"
ldesc: "Gcovr provides a utility for managing the use of the GNU gcov utility and generating summarized code coverage results. This command is inspired by the Python coverage.py package, which provides a similar utility for Python."
